          "predicate": "has composition and alternate names",
          "object": "half green, one quarter red, one quarter blue; also called BGGR, RGBG, GRBG, or RGGB",
          "qualifiers": {}
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "WIKI-001",
        "EVD-001"
      ],
      "rationale": "目标引文（wiki-bayer-filter/evidence-429e23e81582，[0,119)）逐字支持 claim：滤色模式为半绿、四分之一红、四分之一蓝，故亦称 BGGR、RGBG、GRBG 或 RGGB。claim 为引文的忠实转述，无额外断言，判定 supported。单一 target，无多源独立性判定需求。",
