    {
      "claim_id": "bayer-needs-demosaic",
      "verdict": "partially_supported",
      "targets": [
        {
          "source_id": "wiki-bayer-filter",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-97e7b6a0a0ad"
        }
      ],
      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-97e7b6a0a0ad",
          "exact": "Since each pixel is filtered to record only one of three colors, the data from each pixel cannot fully specify each of the red, green, and blue values on its own."
        }
      ],
      "observations": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-97e7b6a0a0ad",
          "subject": "each pixel's filtered data",
          "predicate": "cannot",
          "object": "fully specify each of the red, green, and blue values on its own",
          "qualifiers": {}
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "WIKI-001",
        "EVD-001"
      ],
      "rationale": "目标引文（wiki-bayer-filter/evidence-97e7b6a0a0ad，[0,162)）支持 claim 的前两个命题：每像素仅记录三色之一，单像素数据自身无法完整指定 RGB 值。但 claim 第三命题'需用去马赛克算法由周围同色像素插值得到每个像素的完整红绿蓝值'在引文中无任何对应表述——引文未提及去马赛克算法，也未提及插值或其来源（周围同色像素），该方案性断言属超出引文的推断，判定 partially_supported。单一 target，无多源独立性判定需求。",
